  "fire": [
    {
      "text": "Welcome to the deep valleys where the history is thick",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 5000
    },
    {
      "text": "It is me, Nicholas, standing on the ancient soil of Kiso",
      "startMs": 5000,
      "endMs": 10000
    },
    {
      "text": "Feel the fog, feel the power of the mountains!",
      "startMs": 10000,
      "endMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "text": "(静かに眠る) 中山道の深い霧の中",
      "startMs": 15000,
      "endMs": 17700
    },
    {
      "text": "私は一人 遥かなる時を追いかけてる",
      "startMs": 17700,
      "endMs": 20600
    },
    {
      "text": "開田高原の風が 頬をかすめ掠めてゆくの",
      "startMs": 20600,
      "endMs": 23400
    },
    {
      "text": "お六櫛を そっと髪に挿して歩き出すわ",
      "startMs": 23400,
      "endMs": 26200
    },
    {
      "text": "赤かぶの赤が 雪解けの道に鮮やかに映えて",
      "startMs": 26200,
      "endMs": 29100
    },
    {
      "text": "まるで私の 燃え上がるこの想いみたいよ",
      "startMs": 29100,
      "endMs": 31500
    },
    {
      "text": "百草丸のように この胸の痛みを癒してほしい",
      "startMs": 31500,
      "endMs": 36000
    },
    {
      "text": "あなたを探す旅は まだまだ終わらないのね",
      "startMs": 36000,
      "endMs": 40400
    },
    {
      "text": "木曽の夜空に 咲き誇る星たちよ！",
      "startMs": 40400,
      "endMs": 43600
    },
    {
      "text": "(Give me the power, give me the light!)",
      "startMs": 43600,
      "endMs": 50100
    },
    {
      "text": "ニコラスと私、そしてこの大自然が溶け合うの！",
      "startMs": 50100,
      "endMs": 54900
    },
    {
      "text": "(This is pure cinematic madness!)",
      "startMs": 54900,
      "endMs": 61000
    },
    {
      "text": "どんなに遠く 離れていても心は一つよ！",
      "startMs": 61000,
      "endMs": 65100
    },
    {
      "text": "(From the valley to the world!)",
      "startMs": 65100,
      "endMs": 70700
    },
    {
      "text": "この愛の鼓動は 決して誰にも止められない！",
      "startMs": 70700,
      "endMs": 75300
    },
    {
      "text": "(Yeah, let's ride together!)",
      "startMs": 75300,
      "endMs": 80400
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen up! This is Nicholas in the legendary house of Kiso!",
      "startMs": 80400,
      "endMs": 83300
    },
    {
      "text": "I am eating sunki for breakfast and it is giving me absolute power!",
      "startMs": 83300,
      "endMs": 86200
    },
    {
      "text": "Chewing on this Gohei-mochi and it tastes like straight fire!",
      "startMs": 86200,
      "endMs": 89100
    },
    {
      "text": "You want a piece of this ancient craft? Look at this Kiso-shikki lacquerware!",
      "startMs": 89100,
      "endMs": 92000
    },
    {
      "text": "My style is as sharp as the edges of this wood! (Yeah!)",
      "startMs": 92000,
      "endMs": 96000
    },
    {
      "text": "I am driving fast, feeling wild, no time to look back!",
      "startMs": 96000,
      "endMs": 99000
    },
    {
      "text": "Pure adrenaline pumping through my veins, this is raw cinematic energy!",
      "startMs": 99000,
      "endMs": 103000
    },
    {
      "text": "Kiso Valley, you cannot handle the unstoppable fire in my soul!",
      "startMs": 103000,
      "endMs": 105000
    },
    {
      "text": "木曽の夜空に 咲き誇る星たちよ！",
